WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:13.276
Feather glared at Sprite. "This is your fault."

2
00:00:13.277 --> 00:00:18.527
Bumble nodded. "We’ll fail the test because of you."

3
00:00:18.528 --> 00:00:23.005
Sprite's lip quivered. "I'll fix it."

4
00:00:23.006 --> 00:00:26.959
"Make sure no one sees you!" Hob said.

5
00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:31.436
Sprite zoomed off to find the twins.

6
00:00:31.437 --> 00:00:35.543
One was outside riding a toy horse.

7
00:00:35.544 --> 00:00:41.171
"Kendra!" Sprite thought.

8
00:00:41.172 --> 00:00:44.415
The other girl was inside, dancing to music.

9
00:00:44.416 --> 00:00:48.052
On her bare feet, she spun around wildly.

10
00:00:48.053 --> 00:00:50.880
"Kelly!" Sprite thought.

11
00:00:50.881 --> 00:00:53.841
She looked closely at the socks.

12
00:00:53.842 --> 00:00:58.219
One pair had two tiny holes.

13
00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:01.381
The other pair looked brand-new.

14
00:01:01.382 --> 00:01:07.983
"Easy!" Sprite grinned. "Kelly doesn’t like socks.

15
00:01:07.984 --> 00:01:15.254
So the socks with holes belong to Kendra!"

16
00:01:15.255 --> 00:01:22.750
Sprite dropped the brand-new socks near Kelly.

17
00:01:22.751 --> 00:01:26.355
She dropped the socks with holes near Kendra.

18
00:01:26.356 --> 00:01:32.415
"Phew!" she thought. "Nobody saw me."

19
00:01:32.416 --> 00:01:37.892
Sprite flew back to the rosebush. "All done!"

20
00:01:37.893 --> 00:01:41.134
"Are you sure?" Hob asked.

21
00:01:41.135 --> 00:01:46.137
"Yes," Sprite said. "It was easy!

22
00:01:46.138 --> 00:01:53.650
Now let's watch the gifts appear."

23
00:01:53.651 --> 00:02:02.624
But outside no gift appeared. Inside,

24
00:02:02.625 --> 00:02:06.118
no gift appeared either. The

25
00:02:06.119 --> 00:02:11.037
Queen frowned. "Is there a problem?" "No,"

26
00:02:11.038 --> 00:02:17.875
Sprite said nervously. "Everything's great." Sprite's

27
00:02:17.876 --> 00:02:20.132
heart was pounding. Where

28
00:02:20.133 --> 00:02:22.720
were the birthday gifts? Suddenly

29
00:02:22.721 --> 00:02:25.949
the twins' mother came inside. "Kendra,

30
00:02:25.950 --> 00:02:29.351
turn the music down, please." Sprite

31
00:02:29.352 --> 00:02:36.297
gulped. "Kendra?" Sprite

32
00:02:36.298 --> 00:02:38.377
took off again. Zipping

33
00:02:38.378 --> 00:02:44.022
around, she switched the socks. Soon

34
00:02:44.023 --> 00:02:47.332
a shout came from the garden. "Wow!"

35
00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:54.612
Kelly cried. "Ballet shoes!" Then—

36
00:02:54.613 --> 00:02:58.116
clomp, clomp.

37
00:02:58.117 --> 00:03:04.384
Kendra raced out in riding boots.

38
00:03:04.385 --> 00:03:07.768
The fairies flew back to the carriage.

39
00:03:07.769 --> 00:03:15.757
Sprite was huffing and puffing. "Did . . . we . . . pass?"

40
00:03:15.758 --> 00:03:18.981
"Yes." The Fairy Queen nodded.

41
00:03:18.982 --> 00:03:22.859
"But you did not earn the reward."

42
00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:26.116
"Ugh." Sprite hung her head.

43
00:03:26.117 --> 00:03:30.728
The other fairies groaned.

44
00:03:30.729 --> 00:03:47.985
"You must be more serious, Sprite," the Queen said.

45
00:03:47.986 --> 00:03:52.073
On the way home, the Queen leaned close to Sprite.

46
00:03:52.074 --> 00:03:55.257
"Next time I come," she whispered.

47
00:03:55.258 --> 00:04:05.120
"Will you teach me to juggle?"

